2026-10-06T04:11:26.2386670Z Description:
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2394340Z   forge — Mission Control Language runtime
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2396730Z 
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2397000Z Usage:
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2397380Z   forge [command] [options]
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2398430Z 
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2401050Z Options:
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2402200Z   -?, -h, --help  Show help and usage information
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2402770Z   --version       Show version information
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2403030Z 
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2403340Z Commands:
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2403940Z   init <mission>             Resolve expert sources and generate mcl.lock
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2404620Z   run <mission>              Run a mission
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2405150Z   validate <mission>         Validate a mission file and its expert references
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2405740Z   list                       List available resources
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2406260Z   expert                     Manage experts
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2406730Z   registry                   OCI registry operations
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2407350Z   login                      Sign in to Forge (browser) and store a platform key
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2415450Z   whoami                     Show the signed-in Forge user and credit balance
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2423120Z   logout                     Sign out of Forge (remove the stored platform key)
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2427300Z   exec <target> <prompt>     Run a hosted mission once and print the answer
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2433830Z   chat                       Chat with a hosted mission in the current Forge project
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2437840Z   project                    Manage portable Forge projects
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2443870Z   publish <reference> <dir>  Package a mission directory into a self-contained OCI artifact and push it
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2445740Z   clean                      Remove cached OCI experts from ~/.forge/experts
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2448360Z   serve <agent>              Serve a mission as an OpenAI-compatible endpoint
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2450160Z   claude <target>            Launch Claude Code talking to a forge mission
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2450900Z   connect                    Wire an editor's Claude Code extension to a forge mission
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2451980Z   agent                      Manage forge agents running in Docker
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2452490Z   webui                      Manage Open WebUI connected to a forge agent
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2453700Z   provider                   Manage LLM provider profiles
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2454390Z   mcp <mission>              Expose a mission as a stdio MCP server (for Claude Desktop and MCP-aware tools)
2026-10-06T04:11:26.2454700Z 
